{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> <br>\u2022 <strong>Survive Together\u2026 or Alone</strong> - Survivors can either cooperate as a team or act selfishly. Your survival depends on whether you work together or go solo! Can you open the portal to escape enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machines</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Key and Explosive Bottle Machines</strong> - Craft keys to unlock doors or gather bottles to create explosives. Explosives destroy smaller enemies and slow the main boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/86476457c2ea53a2676d831bb6b187d3.poster.avif?t=1771239407\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/86476457c2ea53a2676d831bb6b187d3.webm?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/86476457c2ea53a2676d831bb6b187d3.mp4?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/b9a1ffec7c5194c97332ef58212864aa.poster.avif?t=1771239407\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/b9a1ffec7c5194c97332ef58212864aa.webm?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/b9a1ffec7c5194c97332ef58212864aa.mp4?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Generator Repair</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Power and Oil</strong> - Repair fuse boxes to restore power to the generator. Add oil bottles to activate it and unleash the Destroyer Portal! Once the portal is open, lure the boss to the portal area to win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/b841a452df757949f4250280e4565b3d.poster.avif?t=1771239407\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/b841a452df757949f4250280e4565b3d.webm?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/b841a452df757949f4250280e4565b3d.mp4?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ability System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Detection</strong> - Reveal enemy locations! Enemies behind walls appear in red. If they\u2019re close, find a hiding spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/ec95ede77076e77c8b52bb9442fcd089.poster.avif?t=1771239407\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/ec95ede77076e77c8b52bb9442fcd089.webm?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/ec95ede77076e77c8b52bb9442fcd089.mp4?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invisibility</strong> - Go invisible to evade enemies or sneak past them for your team. Escape pursuers by vanishing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/81e8cc6cf582a768da340ded73057cb7.poster.avif?t=1771239407\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/81e8cc6cf582a768da340ded73057cb7.webm?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/81e8cc6cf582a768da340ded73057cb7.mp4?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healing</strong> - Activate healing to restore health to all teammates in a specific area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/8e49ff9a8fa286b70f256d48dd4a5f72.poster.avif?t=1771239407\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/8e49ff9a8fa286b70f256d48dd4a5f72.webm?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stun</strong> - Immobilize the main boss! Stop a boss chasing your teammate to provide critical support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/521d6916be5ab83b60603df18524d601.poster.avif?t=1771239407\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/521d6916be5ab83b60603df18524d601.webm?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/extras/521d6916be5ab83b60603df18524d601.mp4?t=1771239407\" type=\"video/mp4\"><